    caption: 
  - id: d.beacons.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d0899464bedf8af49a56f24e5cae5c35, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Press E on the beacon switch beside the microgrid to light the runway.
  - id: d.beacons.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2276f190512834448a2940bd1db7124, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Pull the beacon switch beside the microgrid to light the runway.
  - id: d.clear.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf8324053d64a6f42a159bf6c4637d18, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The runway is lit. Press E on the departure lever.
  - id: d.clear.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 96ac86fa39e3743488c1dcbe946188f3, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The runway is lit. Pull the departure lever.
  - id: d.welcome
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad408cc04f826074795866bd7925dcea, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Welcome to Nacre Bay. One bridge, one hydrogen cell, one clean flight. Let's go.
  - id: e1.choice
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3628c2f09fc4b964098ba541d9b00028, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: We have one spare bridge, and the power cable runs inside it. The west crossing is a long drive. The east one is shorter, but its harbour corner is broken too.
  - id: e1.crossed
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c2082146e1733f7459bfb8a7961ed720, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: You built that bridge with your own hands, and now you've driven across it. Nicely done.
  - id: e1.east_needs_corner
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b102985829185c4d9dcf0f141ce35a7, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Nearly there. The harbour corner beside it is broken. Find the right piece and turn it to fit.
  - id: e1.plinth
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a91618e00ff746141b683e0ca2f90fc2, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: This model is the real city below us. Change one, and you change the other.
  - id: e1.route_east
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 29058442dd2104a4b845ec8926406db4, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The shortcut is open, and clean power is flowing to the island!
  - id: e1.route_west
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90d85a95afadb6f47a939d2da86438d9, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The road is through, and wind and solar power are flowing to the island!
  - id: e1.welcome
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc7053bd4bc3baf4e9f60d999e8286ca, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Welcome to Nacre Bay. I'm Noor, the city's energy engineer. A storm is coming, and it has cut our clean power link.
  - id: e2.brief
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9987c5be86a02644ab111116b54479e, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The airfield microgrid is dark. Carry a green hydrogen fuel cell across your causeway and restart it. The storm won't wait.
  - id: e2.convoy
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a3fb637c4c22874dbddb7f996012c27, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The electric shuttles are rolling out along your route.
  - id: e2.deliver.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21ac071218f087e4fae1edac84bad974, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Take the cell from the cradle with E, and press E again at the microgrid socket.
  - id: e2.deliver.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d493b0762301ae4439c8f63f1e210441, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Take the cell from the cradle and plug it into the microgrid socket.
  - id: e2.drive
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f52afbcdbe5b8884f93e7d3eeae9f85c, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Follow the guide lights to the microgrid. Checkpoints will catch you if you leave the road.
  - id: e2.powered
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4fdb32d3bbd63614f901f8cb5d3f33e2, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The microgrid is back! The batteries are charging, and the island's lights are on.
  - id: e3.beacons.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f74c78b656a550c46b75a8cfb13904e6, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Now switch on the solar runway beacons. Press E at each switch.
  - id: e3.beacons.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7431617a85ba1004dbc11d817c35f221, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Now switch on the solar runway beacons. Point at each switch and pull the trigger.
  - id: e3.brief
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3b02cb90bbdf7b045ac0767f0e6e1bf5, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: One flight left before the storm closes the sky, and it's our first zero-emission plane. The terminal road is still broken, so the shuttles can't reach it.
  - id: e3.clear.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e79c6fc497f75704483f4da67dcd3444, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Everything is ready. Press E on the departure lever in the tower.
  - id: e3.clear.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e2a93825697722e42a725bbd0679f179, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Everything is ready. Pull the departure lever in the tower.
  - id: e3.convoy_arrived
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcd7091d78f5c234ead98cf524154bec, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The shuttles are at the terminal. Passengers are boarding.
  - id: e3.end
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cd7a11b24a205448bd1c216250e511e, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The city is safe, and it runs on clean power. And it's still the one you built.
  - id: e3.fold.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3903bf13197f6e9469936b9bfc765b77, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Use the airfield Fold Station. Press Q.
  - id: e3.fold.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6618e6161a8cab44492ddd17a024a3cb, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Use the airfield Fold Station. Press X.
  - id: e3.link
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e52edfe4d6e0aba4fbea2d6c6bfcb9fe, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Repair the terminal access link. Watch which way the roads meet.
  - id: e3.takeoff
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b7310a24437b744f9ba88ba1557fdc0, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: 'Nacre tower: clean flight, you are clear. Hydrogen in, only water out. Look at her go!'
  - id: g.car_respawn
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2dd28387d4faa84abc91b872cf68048, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Let's put you back on the road.
  - id: g.cell_respawn
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 633a01cd9bfb92649bc60b3286d41a2e, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: No harm done. A fresh hydrogen cell is waiting at the dock.
  - id: g.checkpoint
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 50397445102442d428575822711b1574, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Checkpoint.
  - id: g.fail
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f30c07d73e6ec064e83af64b5b186305, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The storm reached us. That's alright. Let's try again from the last checkpoint.
  - id: g.hint_socket
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bbfd71441c686d84f954b8d95a7464f1, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Look for the sockets glowing teal on the model.
  - id: g.remote_drive
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 658d5d25b404e4c4c8334050fc04ee07, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Remote drive is on. You'll steer the car from right here.
  - id: g.retry
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a0ba9d0c9325ca44abd5bf6d1481d37, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Back at the checkpoint. You've got this.
  - id: g.storm_final
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ae4283b3a00cd741822070a93512424, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Thirty seconds!
  - id: g.storm_warning
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6674d4bef6368834b8b4d7728cdbfb5b, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The storm is close. Two minutes left.
  - id: t.cell.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d711db8fc53444429f9013cd5e05f29, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Press E to pick up the hydrogen cell, then press E at the car to load it.
  - id: t.cell.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e7348741a19bb664e88836f90b4e6e86, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Grab the hydrogen cell from the dock and set it in the car's cradle.
  - id: t.drive.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f81afa06b5ce2a438840ad8dd3257ce, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: W accelerates, S brakes and reverses, and A and D steer.
  - id: t.drive.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 467443682c1f2714b8c1b35f469fa0ea, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: The left stick steers. The right trigger accelerates, and the left trigger brakes.
  - id: t.enter.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1606a55b86d0e0498b6c4a6b3d2fc9c, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Press E at the car door to climb in.
  - id: t.enter.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b54e1f3fa8a4304f8b9a79f22b4fe7f, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Point at the car door and pull the trigger to climb in.
  - id: t.fold.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad62022ac78a3b84cbee40864e35ebd2, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Press Q to fold down into the street.
  - id: t.fold.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 186e375320fa8124ab58a148dc2e1b1b, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Press X to fold down into the street.
  - id: t.grab.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae471b0c98bc31b438241163c44ce6e8, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Click and hold the bridge piece on the tray to pick it up.
  - id: t.grab.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d112e3abfe322e6458d1f4c8568ae6ac, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Reach for the bridge piece on the tray and squeeze the grip to pick it up.
  - id: t.place.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 88d57087aea61b14187f32578344012b, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Press R to turn it until its ends meet the road, then let go over a glowing socket.
  - id: t.place.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb79647296364bd4e841c66476c26e4c, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Turn it until its ends meet the road, then let go over a glowing socket.
  - id: t.walk.desktop
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d67b75d9710473b49934e1c67a694700, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Walk with W, A, S and D, and look around with the mouse. The courier car is just ahead.
  - id: t.walk.vr
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d720b37a17cacb843a87d1cd28788f93, type: 3}
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    spatial: 0
    volumeDb: 0
    caption: Move with the left stick, or hold A to aim a teleport and let go to jump. The courier car is just ahead.
